28\" data-end=\"1380\"><strong data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"664\" id=\"isPasted\">Attractive Commission Structure</strong><br data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"667\">Earn 10–15% per sale, with a bonus of up to 15% on first-time customer purchases made through your link.</p></li><li data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1380\"><p data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1380\"><strong data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"998\" id=\"isPasted\">Minimum Payout</strong><br data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1001\">NO Minimum Payout Limit, Once your commission hits a sale, you can cash out via<strong data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1089\">&nbsp;direct bank transfer</strong>—fast, secure, and flexible.</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 17px; color: rgb(60, 60, 60); font-family: Poppins; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.24px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" id=\"isPasted\"><br></p></div></div>",
